# Keep generated/vendored web assets byte-identical across platforms. Both carry a documented
# SHA-256 (Assets/Html/vendor/README.md, Assets/Fonts/variable/README.md); EOL conversion would
# change their content hash on checkout and make those records wrong.
Assets/Html/vendor/tailwind.min.js -text
Assets/Html/fonts.css              -text

# Upstream sources use CRLF; treat carriage returns as line endings in diff checks.
* whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
